unes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0:19.385" end="0:25.208" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.385" end="0:20.188">带你出</span><span begin="0:20.188" end="0:20.889">去兜</span><span begin="0:20.889" end="0:21.158">兜</span><span begin="0:21.158" end="0:21.471">风</span><span begin="0:21.471" end="0:21.729">然</span><span begin="0:21.729" end="0:21.880">后</span><span begin="0:21.880" end="0:23.066">一起去海边</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:23.155" end="0:25.208"><span begin="0:23.155" end="0:23.396">(带</span><span begin="0:23.396" end="0:23.698">你</span><span begin="0:23.698" end="0:24.238">去海</span><span begin="0:24.238" end="0:25.208">边)</span></span></p><p begin="0:23.804" end="0:29.631" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.804" end="0:24.071">海</span><span begin="0:24.071" end="0:24.222">风</span><span begin="0:24.222" end="0:24.524">吹</span><span begin="0:24.524" end="0:26.328">乱你的头发让</span><span begin="0:26.328" end="0:26.608">我</span><span begin="0:26.608" end="0:27.232">亲吻</span><span begin="0:27.232" end="0:27.459">你</span><span begin="0:27.459" end="0:27.818">香</span><span begin="0:27.818" end="0:28.346">肩</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:28.108" end="0:29.631"><span begin="0:28.108" end="0:28.313">(美</span><span begin="0:28.313" end="0:28.465">女</span><span begin="0:28.465" end="0:28.786">都</span><span begin="0:28.786" end="0:29.089">跑</span><span begin="0:29.089" end="0:29.631">哩)</span></span></p><p begin="0:28.628" end="0:34.453" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.628" end="0:30.903">我看着你的眼睛</span> <span begin="0:30.903" end="0:31.205">一</span><span begin="0:31.205" end="0:31.507">不</span><span begin="0:31.507" end="0:32.113">小心</span><span begin="0:32.113" end="0:32.340">动</span><span begin="0:32.340" end="0:32.946">了情</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:32.879" end="0:34.453"><span begin="0:32.879" end="0:33.364">(You are my</span> <span begin="0:33.364" end="0:33.742">only</span> <span begin="0:33.742" end="0:34.453">one)</span></span></p><p begin="0:33.465" end="0:37.894" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.465" end="0:33.790">你</span><span begin="0:33.790" end="0:33.941">的</span><span begin="0:33.941" end="0:34.558">笑容</span><span begin="0:34.558" end="0:34.798">让</span><span begin="0:34.798" end="0:35.013">我</span><span begin="0:35.013" end="0:35.623">心旷</span><span begin="0:35.623" end="0:35.979">神</span><span begin="0:35.979" end="0:36.684">怡有</span><span begin="0:36.684" end="0:36.962">一</span><span begin="0:36.962" end="0:37.113">点</span><span begin="0:37.113" end="0:37.492">眩</span><span begin="0:37.492" end="0:37.894">晕</span></p></div><div begin="0:38.349" end="1:07.608" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0:38.349" end="0:40.692" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:38.349" end="0:38.560">如</span><span begin="0:38.560" end="0:39.931">果说爱你我肯定是最</span><span begin="0:39.931" end="0:40.378">嚣张</span><span begin="0:40.378" end="0:40.692">的</span></p><p begin="0:40.692" end="0:43.159" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:40.692" end="0:40.949">今</span><span begin="0:40.949" end="0:42.392">晚为你包的餐厅是最</span><span begin="0:42.392" end="0:42.706">高</span><span begin="0:42.706" end="0:42.857">档</span><span begin="0:42.857" end="0:43.159">的</span></p><p begin="0:43.159" end="0:45.596" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:43.159" end="0:43.865">我喊他放点</span><span begin="0:43.865" end="0:44.094">Metro</span> <span begin="0:44.094" end="0:44.413">Booming</span><span begin="0:44.413" end="0:44.716">莫</span><span begin="0:44.716" end="0:44.792">放</span><span begin="0:44.792" end="0:45.136">肖</span><span begin="0:45.136" end="0:45.596">邦的</span></p><p begin="0:45.596" end="0:47.992" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:45.596" end="0:47.236">走到现在靠的实力不是</span><span begin="0:47.236" end="0:47.992">包装的</span></p><p begin="0:48.182" end="0:50.972" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:48.182" end="0:48.519">你</span><span begin="0:48.519" end="0:49.645">晓得撒我平时都听</span><span begin="0:49.645" end="0:50.221">Turn歌</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:50.224" end="0:50.972"><span begin="0:50.224" end="0:50.577">(Turn</span><span begin="0:50.577" end="0:50.972">歌)</span></span></p><p begin="0:50.577" end="0:53.815" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:50.577" end="0:50.710">哥</span><span begin="0:50.710" end="0:51.454">们儿不是那些</span><span begin="0:51.454" end="0:52.050">崽儿脸上</span><span begin="0:52.050" end="0:52.278">粉</span><span begin="0:52.278" end="0:52.328">儿</span><span begin="0:52.328" end="0:52.744">多</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:52.540" end="0:53.815"><span begin="0:52.540" end="0:53.194">(粉儿</span><span begin="0:53.194" end="0:53.815">多)</span></span></p><p begin="0:52.874" end="0:56.194" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:52.874" end="0:54.554">只有你能让我认输我说</span><span begin="0:54.554" end="0:55.096">儿豁</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:54.899" end="0:56.194"><span begin="0:54.899" end="0:55.416">(儿</span><span begin="0:55.416" end="0:56.194">豁)</span></span></p><p begin="0:55.212" end="0:58.230" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:55.212" end="0:55.434">在</span><span begin="0:55.434" end="0:56.454">你的面前我可以</span><span begin="0:56.454" end="0:56.586">是</span><span begin="0:56.586" end="0:57.014">个耙</span><span begin="0:57.014" end="0:57.252">耳</span><span begin="0:57.252" end="0:57.619">朵</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:57.402" end="0:58.230"><span begin="0:57.402" end="0:57.827">(耳</span><span begin="0:57.827" end="0:58.230">朵)</span></span></p><p begin="0:57.775" end="1:00.240" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:57.775" end="0:58.044">虽</span><span begin="0:58.044" end="0:58.605">然以前的</span><span begin="0:58.605" end="0:59.944">我还会担心饭都吃不</span><span begin="0:59.944" end="1:00.240">饱</span></p><p begin="1:00.240" end="1:02.450" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:00.240" end="1:01.898">现在我能够让我爱的人都</span><span begin="1:01.898" end="1:02.450">越过越好</span></p><p begin="1:02.651" end="1:04.887" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:02.651" end="1:02.739">每</span><span begin="1:02.739" end="1:04.887">次和你聊起过往我的话都不会少</span></p><p begin="1:05.160" end="1:07.608" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:05.160" end="1:05.403">你</span><span begin="1:05.403" end="1:05.554">总</span><span begin="1:05.554" end="1:07.217">是和我想得一样永远这么</span><span begin="1:07.217" end="1:07.608">巧</span></p></div><div begin="1:07.816" end="1:26.097" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:07.816" end="1:13.305" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.816" end="1:08.666">带你出</span><span begin="1:08.666" end="1:09.288">去兜</span><span begin="1:09.288" end="1:09.531">兜</span><span begin="1:09.531" end="1:09.907">风</span><span begin="1:09.907" end="1:10.058">然</span><span begin="1:10.058" end="1:10.376">后</span><span begin="1:10.376" end="1:10.811">一起</span><span begin="1:10.811" end="1:10.961">去</span><span begin="1:10.961" end="1:11.339">海</span><span begin="1:11.339" end="1:11.706">边</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:11.763" end="1:13.305"><span begin="1:11.763" end="1:12.025">(带</span><span begin="1:12.025" end="1:12.088">你</span><span begin="1:12.088" end="1:12.414">去</span><span begin="1:12.414" end="1:12.694">海</span><span begin="1:12.694" end="1:13.305">边)</span></span></p><p begin="1:12.364" end="1:18.125" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.364" end="1:12.647">海</span><span begin="1:12.647" end="1:12.798">风</span><span begin="1:12.798" end="1:13.100">吹</span><span begin="1:13.100" end="1:13.554">乱你</span><span begin="1:13.554" end="1:13.705">的</span><span begin="1:13.705" end="1:14.063">头</span><span begin="1:14.063" end="1:15.127">发让我</span><span begin="1:15.127" end="1:15.442">亲</span><span begin="1:15.442" end="1:15.743">吻</span><span begin="1:15.743" end="1:15.894">你</span><span begin="1:15.894" end="1:16.179">香</span><span begin="1:16.179" end="1:16.874">肩</span><sp